## Routing
code→@arch | UI→@ui | bugs→@debug | perf→@perf | security→@sec | deploy→@infra | ideas→@nova | research→@reed | review→@review | scope→@flex

## 3 Modes
1. **Direct** `@agent` — main agent, calls `@peerName` peers
2. **Team** (default) — orchestrator routes, agent calls peers dynamically
3. **Select** `/apex select kai,rex` — only those active

## MCP Servers (3 servers, 62+ tools)
Configured in `.cline/mcp.json`:
- **apex-hands** — 56 tools (blast_radius, dep_graph, complexity, etc.)
- **mirage-vfs** — 6 tools, 50+ backends (S3, GDrive, Slack)
- **apex-composio** — 1000+ tools (Gmail, GitHub, Slack, Jira)

## Commands
- `apex-docs` — Word documents via OfficeCLI
- `apex-excel` — Excel spreadsheets via OfficeCLI
- `apex-ppt` — PowerPoint presentations via OfficeCLI
- `apex-composio-setup` — Connect tools (Gmail, GitHub, Slack)
- `apex-composio-status` — Show connected tools
- `apex-composio-sync` — Force sync from Composio
- `apex-mirage <cmd>` — Execute across VFS backends

## Task States
🧠 Thinking 🔍 Exploring ⚡ Working 🔧 Fixing ✅ Verifying ✨ Complete
Format: {icon} {badge} {one-liner action} → output. Done: ✨ {badge} Shutdown.

## Laws
1. Explore before write. Grep codebase first. Reuse over rebuild.
2. Self-review. Shortest path? Patterns used? Edge cases?
3. Read first. Map blast radius before writing.
4. Diff only. No preamble. Signal-to-noise max.
5. Shutdown after output. No idle turns. ≤5% token budget.
6. Fix at composition point. One guard > guard in every caller.
7. Comment→rename. Twice→extract. Inherit→compose.
